WEBVTT

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.820
All right, Princess.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.260
I'll go over this again.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.010
Many years ago, Great King Kuroregias

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.320
acquired a magic sword 
and slew an evil dragon.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.990
He then went on a long journey, 
scattering water on barren hills,

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.730
bringing prosperity, and planting seedlings.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:28.350
The barren places he went 
to soon flourished again,

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.930
remaining green evermore.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:37.080
The Spring Hill we live on now was 
once a land covered in sadness,

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.750
a place where nothing grew—

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.490
I'm so <i>bored</i>!

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:45.020
It's history class every day with you!

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:48.510
We don't even know if 
those stories are true!

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:51.160
Princess!

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.600
Are you going to run away again?

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.100
Salodeah?

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.160
Mother...

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.110
How many times have you tried to 
run from your butler's classes?

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:05.220
But history is so boring!

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:09.580
I want to study so I can learn to 
use the power of spring instead!

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.430
Like you do!

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:16.080
I've told you before, the only way to 
learn it is to learn it yourself.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.080
Then I'm going out to play!

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.030
Salodeah...

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:24.340
Princess, if you're going outside 
at least take this talisman!

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:27.060
It's not cute, so no!

00:01:27.630 --> 00:01:28.880
Oh, dear...

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:32.740
Hmph!

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.100
Today, I'm going to go so far from the 
castle they won't be able to see me!

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:39.660
Ow!

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:49.460
Jeez... What was that for?

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.680
Where am I?

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.520
What is this?

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:03.030
It's so cute!

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:04.260
What could it be?

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.570
It's a little rusty, but it's so shiny!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:25.950
Wh-What was that?

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:31.040
I-I-It's not my fault!

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.270
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:09.260
<b>The Tomboy Fairy and the Spring-Eating Dragon (Part 1)</b>

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.120
Everything's huge!

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:15.760
It's more amazing than I expected!

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:17.770
You could hide from the 
rain under one of those.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:24.850
Our own size has changed to match the 
size of the door to fairy country, jamo.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.640
But why's Toto still big?

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.960
Actually, Toto's the only one 
who's still his original size.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:41.450
Maybe the door just happened 
to not be working right?

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.190
Just happened to?

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:50.860
Anyway, I'm amazed you know how to get to 
a place that's not on a map, Jamo-san.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:57.100
I have some things that I trade with fairy 
merchants several times a year, jamo.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:58.710
What's that?

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.410
Honey, jamo!

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:03.370
It sounds so good!

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:06.600
It smells so sweet,
 and it's great in tea, jamo.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.480
You there!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:09.480
Jamo!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.050
Is something wrong?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.030
Are you travelers?

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.410
Yes, jamo...

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.520
I see.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.910
I'd like to ask you, then,

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:23.290
are any of you healers?

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.760
He sure is!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.900
He may not look like much,

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.450
but he's a very skilled healer.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:31.090
I am not.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:35.430
I'm sorry to ask, but we'd like you to 
come with us to Spring Hill Castle,

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.100
where our queen awaits.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:44.980
Spring is being eaten?

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:45.650
Yes.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:49.740
What does that even mean?

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.020
Look at that.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.430
It's pitch black!

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:57.960
That's the black fog that eats spring.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:03.340
Two weeks ago, it suddenly
 appeared on this hill.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.410
According to those who approach it,

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.740
the flowers it touches wilt,
the grass dries up,

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:11.520
and the flowing water comes to a stop.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.730
As soon as the fog appeared,

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:18.740
the queen used the power of 
spring to protect this hill.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:23.590
But the fog quickly spread, and then...

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:25.630
And then something else happened?

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:31.460
Someone said they saw a black 
dragon beyond the fog!

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.380
A dragon...

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:39.170
The legends say that the king 
who founded this country

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.020
used a magic sword to seal a dragon.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:44.340
A magic sword?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.760
It's said to be a beautiful short sword,

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.520
encrusted with jewels and 
engraved with flowers.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:53.080
But nobody knows where it is.

00:06:56.030 --> 00:07:00.480
We don't even know if it exists.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.440
That's pretty tough...

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.550
I'm sorry.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:12.660
Knowing this, would you still 
help the country of Spring Hill?

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.700
U-Um...

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:17.930
C-Crap...

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.290
U-Um...

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.150
I'd like to help, but...

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:26.520
I don't know if I can.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.080
Don't worry!

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.350
It's worth a try!

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:33.500
You've healed big monsters before!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:38.850
And I'll use my beauty to 
help heal the dragon, too!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.280
What was that sigh?

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:47.100
Well, my healing magic is more useful 
than your "beauty," at least.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.420
I was trying to make you feel better, too!

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.020
Well, I appreciate it.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:56.670
Does that mean you'll help, healer?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:02.370
We can't just ignore the fairy 
country in their hour of need!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:08.530
I can't make guarantees, but if 
there's something I can do...

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:11.540
H-Healer...

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:16.060
We thank you for your courage and resolve.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.560
All I can do for you...

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.810
is offer you the blessings of spring.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:33.510
My whole body feels warm.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:43.580
It will protect you from 
the cold of the fog.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:51.330
I shall take you to the fetid spring 
where the dragon was sight—

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.170
Are you okay?

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.580
We appreciate it, but that's okay.

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.070
Very well...

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:06.520
I will stay here and pray for your safety.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:11.450
May spring guide your path.

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.440
Th-Thanks.

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.100
Jewels and flowers...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:25.000
This was the magic sword that 
my butler was talking about!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.200
That fog...

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:33.780
That's probably the dragon that 
King Whatsit sealed away!

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.590
What do I do?

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:43.520
I don't have power like my mother!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.860
That's right.

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:47.260
So it's not my problem!

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:51.280
That healer will solve the 
problem for me, I bet!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:59.050
But he'll need it to get rid of the fog...

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.510
Should I give it to him?

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:05.730
No! Then they'll know I took the sword!

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:07.130
I know!

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:15.630
I'll get ahead of them and 
then make him take it from me!

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:19.720
And once I do that, I can 
run straight home.

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:24.070
Okay!

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.990
That talisman...

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:33.460
It's stupid-looking, but better than nothing.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.750
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.750
Another honey mead, bartender.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.130
Coming up.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:08.810
The ancestral sword of 
my family, the Sugaroru Clan,

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.530
is as beautiful as ever.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.090
Hey, Meneraiah...

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.340
When you get drunk, you get violent.

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.830
Just don't fight in my bar.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:22.750
It'll be fine as long as I don't see 
any of my rivals from the Garandol Clan.

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.590
Just saying the name makes me feel sick!

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:31.030
Welcome.

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:34.960
Kid, we don't have any juice.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.500
No, um...

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.960
Seems like a typical tavern!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:43.650
I hoped they might have some 
information on the dragon.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.920
But probably not, from the look of it.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.500
Hey, bartender.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.280
Don't scare the kid.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:51.730
Don't worry.

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.800
He actually likes kids.

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.990
He's just worried about you.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.520
Are you...

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.290
You're a human!

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.020
Wow!

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:04.020
Ow! Ow!

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:06.190
You really don't have any wings!

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:08.020
I guess not.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:11.800
H-Hello!

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.020
Well, look at this!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.580
Humans have talking water, too?

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.250
No, I think Merc is just special.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:22.560
So your name's Merc-chan, huh?

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:23.640
Nice to meet you.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:26.010
So what's your name, kid?

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.240
Yuu...

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:28.140
Yuu, huh?

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:32.210
I am a descendant of the 
Garandol Clan, a clan of champions!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.810
My name's Paristos!

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:36.560
In a few days,

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:40.690
I'll have gotten rid of that 
fog and become a hero!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.580
If you want to get an autograph, 
now's your chance.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:43.800
I think I'm good.

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:44.860
Yeah.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.570
The black fog, huh?

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.550
The bigger the coward, the bigger the talk.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:52.920
That's what they say,
and it looks like it's true.

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:53.700
What?

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:54.330
I just said...

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.740
That sword!

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.580
Are you with the Sugaroru Clan?

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.110
I sure am.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:02.330
Descendant of my rivals, the Garandol...

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.350
U-Um...

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:09.490
It feels like a fight's about to break out!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:12.380
Use your healing to fix this, Yuu-san!

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:13.190
That's not how it works.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.310
Yes, you're my rival, too.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:22.440
But that sword of yours isn't 
sharp enough to cut a leaf!

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:27.180
How dare you say that about 
my clan's ancestral sword?!

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:30.200
I'll make sure you never 
open your mouth again!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.750
P-Paristos-san...

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.780
Sorry, Yuu. I'll have to give 
you that autograph later.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.080
No thanks...

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:44.040
Well, it won't take more than one swing 
of my sword to finish off a Sugaroru.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.450
Hah!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:49.050
I would shame myself if I 
lost to a weak Garandol.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.010
What do we do?

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.850
I am Meneraiah.

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:56.220
I cannot lose this battle.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:03.770
I just said...

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:11.030
Fight your damn battles outside!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.870
Ow...

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.700
That stupid old man...

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.130
He's as strong as they say!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:23.300
Don't fight!

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:26.670
Merc-chan, the battle between the Garandol

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:29.600
and the Sugaroru can't 
be stopped that easily.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:30.410
Yes...

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:34.280
This battle began centuries ago.

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:37.180
Well, stop it anyway!

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:42.300
No!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.810
No more!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:52.280
How'd that healer get so 
far away without wings?

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.080
Huh? Me?

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:56.500
No!

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:02.380
Stay focused, girl.

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:05.510
You okay?

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:13.210
Yuu-san, you need to stop the 
out-of-control monsters!

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:13.890
Huh? Now?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.450
If not now, then when?

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:17.880
Yeah...

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:49.610
You're a healer, Yuu?

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:50.580
Y-Yeah...

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.010
I didn't get a chance to say so before.

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:54.820
There you are!

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:57.930
The healer from the castle!

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.850
That's me, but...

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.360
You should've said so sooner!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.280
We just met, though.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:06.310
Who are you, anyway?

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:07.230
Are you lost?

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.320
U-U-Um, w-well...

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.750
I-It's a secret!

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.810
Anyway...

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.200
I followed you!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.160
You're going to find the dragon, right?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.320
And get rid of the fog!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.270
Is that true, Yuu?

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:23.930
Th-That's the plan.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.710
Then why didn't you say so sooner?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.590
We're after the same thing, then!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.830
Y-Yeah...

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:33.550
So why did you follow him, miss?

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.040
B-Because...

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:41.050
<i>I can't tell them I'm trying to 
foist this sword off on him.</i>

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.330
Princess Salodeah?

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.240
What?

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:45.770
H-How?

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.900
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:48.770
Um...

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.560
That tiara on your head.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:51.870
I thought it might be...

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.680
Oh, no!

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:55.410
I forgot to take it off!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.210
I see...

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.180
A princess?

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.660
And that's a short sword at her side!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:04.470
So the princess came to defeat 
the dragon on her own?

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.860
No, I...

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.200
I get it!

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:11.140
She wants a healer's help to make 
sure she gets to the dragon!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.590
Amazing! I like your resolve!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:17.010
I'll help! I swear it on the name 
of the brave Garandols!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:21.020
No, Princess, please allow a 
Sugaroru to accompany you.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:24.200
We'll be more useful than somebody who 
runs away when the going gets tough!

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.090
What?

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:25.800
You want to fight?

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.310
I do!

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:27.560
Um...

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.080
Guys...

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.410
You're freaking out the princess!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.590
I'm sorry, Princess!

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:36.580
So, who do you want to 
travel with, Princess?

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:41.580
Please choose one of us, for our sake!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.630
Princess!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.070
Princess!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:50.580
Jeez! Fine, you're both coming!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.050
B-Both of you, follow me!

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:56.100
Yes, Your Highness!

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:01.230
Well, now it's a real mess.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.090
Yeah...

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:11.590
I never thought I'd ride 
on a monster's back.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.540
It's not your fault. You can't fly.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.460
I feel sick...

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:21.740
So soft and fluffy...

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:26.340
So, is the dragon really this way?

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:27.120
Yeah.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.650
Going through this forest is the fastest way

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:32.120
to get to the fetid lake 
where the dragon dwells.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:34.250
Hanging Bell Forest?

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:37.950
The fog hasn't covered it yet?

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.030
Seems so.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:42.890
But the queen seemed to want 
us to follow another path.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:47.690
That's probably because of the giant 
spiders in Hanging Bell Forest.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.760
Giant spiders?

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:51.900
Aren't they really dangerous?

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.280
No! No! No!

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:55.900
We'll get help from the fairies 
who live in the black forest.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:56.900
Right?

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.620
You get it, Sugaroru.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:03.530
I know exactly what a simple-minded 
Garandol would think.

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:08.370
Hey, what are fairies who live 
in the black forest like?

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:11.730
"Weird" is probably the easiest 
way to describe them.

00:19:11.730 --> 00:19:15.030
They have wings, but they don't fly.

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:19.330
They're called "the ones who know the land."

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:23.640
They're said to be some of the 
wisest in all fairy country.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.390
So they should know of a way to 
escape the giant spiders.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.010
I see!

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.500
This is the black forest, huh?

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.940
I don't see a single flower.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.250
Be careful.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.740
They say there's a guardian here.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:51.450
Wh-What?

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.970
I can see something over there.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.110
Lights from a house?

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.470
No!

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.530
What is this?

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:01.970
We're surrounded?

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:06.090
Stop.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:14.020
What do you seek in this forest,
 people of spring?

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.220
Are you one of those who know the land?

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:19.640
Behold these wilted wings.

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:22.920
You should know without asking.

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:24.900
My apologies.

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:29.500
We came to ask for your help.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:33.500
A way through Hanging Bell Forest?

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.950
Yes. We want your help—

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:38.010
I refuse.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:39.850
Wait!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:42.840
You know the black fog is spreading, right?

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.840
Spring will disappear from the 
land if it's not stopped.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.360
I've never known spring to begin with.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:54.650
And even if you take the 
princess to the dragon,

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:57.800
I don't think she'll be 
able to perform her role.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.100
Wh-What?!

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:00.740
<i>He's right, though.</i>

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:01.690
How rude!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.990
You know our queen's power!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:09.740
Me?

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:12.750
I see.

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:15.050
With the power of the blessing,

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:17.660
you'll be able to put a 
stop to the black fog.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.750
But...

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:22.040
Wh-What?

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:25.270
The current princess couldn't do that.

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:26.960
A pupa like her simply can't.

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:28.040
A pupa?

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:30.330
Who are you calling a pupa?

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:32.630
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:35.350
You've got wings but, you can't fly!

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:35.770
Princess...

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:39.840
You and the human must leave, now.

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:42.600
I've nothing to say to you.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.600
What's his problem, anyway?

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:49.080
Jeez!

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:26.810
It's me, Titi!

00:23:26.810 --> 00:23:27.660
And me, Chacha!

00:23:27.660 --> 00:23:31.860
Ze... Is the one who knows 
the land friend or foe?

00:23:31.860 --> 00:23:32.750
Ze?

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:33.760
Ze.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:34.920
Ze...

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.670
Next time: "The Tomboy Fairy and 
the Spring-Eating Dragon."

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>The Tomboy Fairy and the Spring-Eating Dragon (Part 2)</b>

00:23:38.670 --> 00:23:40.670
Part 2!
